              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 17:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishowe siyaweza kuvumirira zaidi, náona baha nisale Atheni machiyangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nákata shauri kumhuma mwenehu Timothi kpwenu. Naye ni muhumwa wa Mlungu wa kutangaza habari nono kuhusu Jesu ariyehuokola. Nami námhuma ili edze akutiyeni nguvu na akutiyeni moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Náhenda hivyo kpwa kusikale na yeyesi ndiyericha kumkuluphira Jesu kpwa sababu ya mateso higa. Mana mnamanya kukala mateso dza higo ni mpango wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha wakati huriphokala phamwenga hwakuambirani chimbere kukala hundateswa, na kama mmanyavyo, hivyo ndivyo vyokala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hino ndiyo sababu ya kumhuma Timothi. Siyaweza kuvumirira, ndiyo mana námhuma ili edze alole ichikala mcheremkuluphira Jesu. Kala nina wasiwasi chahi Shetani wakuchengani muchiricha kukuluphira, na kazi yehu ikale ya bure!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
