            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi Timothi akauya, naye akahurehera habari za kuhutiya moyo kuhusu mendzwa yenu na vira muendereravyo kukuluphira. Akahuambira kukala munahutambukira chila wakati na muna hamu ya kuhuona dza vivyo hurivyo na hamu ya kukuonani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo enehu, katika tabu na mateso gehu gosi hukatiywa moyo kpwa sababu ya kudina kpwenu chilume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hipha sambi maroho gehu gakauya phamwenga kpwa kusikira kala mkadina chilume kpwa kumkuluphira Bwana Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tahuweza kuricha kumshukuru Mlungu kpwa sababu ya raha ambayo munahutiya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunazidi kuvoya Mlungu usiku na mutsi, tsona hunavoya na mioyo yehu yosi, ili huphahe nafwasi ya kukuonani matso kpwa matso. Chisha hukufundzeni mambo zaidi ambago ni mgamanye kuhusu kumkuluphira Bwana Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunavoya Baba Mlungu mwenye na Bwana wehu Jesu ahutengezere njira ili hwedze vi sambi sambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Bwana Jesu naakutiyeni mbazi, mmendzane na kumendza atu osi, dza swiswi hunavyokumendzani. Namwi hendani hivyo zaidi na zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chihivyo andatiya nguvu mioyo yenu, namwi tamundakala na lawama wala makosa mbere za Baba Mlungu, wakati Bwana wehu Jesu ndiphokpwedza na malaikae osi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Malaikae",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Mana yanjina ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "atue.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
